  "comment": "Sastrawi Python Sastrawi Python is a simple python library which allows you to reduce inflected words in Indonesian Language (Bahasa Indonesia) to their base form (stem). This is Python port of the original Sastrawi project written in PHP (credits goes to the original author and contributors of Sastrawi PHP). Contents 1 Cara Install 2 Penggunaan 3 Demo 4 Lisensi 5 Referensi Cara Install Sastrawi",
